          "To promote voluntary dispute settlement and curb protracted appellate litigation, Parliament inserted Section 270AA, providing an executive window for obtaining absolute statutory immunity from the imposition of penalties under Section 270A and initiation of criminal prosecution under Section 276C or 276CCC.",
