        "example": "A managing director fabricates export invoices to evade Rs 1 Crore in corporate tax. The tax department issues a show-cause notice for prosecution under Section 276C(1) and Section 277. Facing up to 7 years imprisonment, the company applies for Compounding under Section 279(2), remits the compounding fee (approx. 50% of tax evaded), and secures permanent termination of criminal proceedings.",
        "code": "def evaluate_criminal_prosecution(tax_evaded_inr: float, is_willful_attempt: bool, can_compound: bool) -> dict:\n    if not is_willful_attempt:\n        return {\"prosecution_initiated\": False, \"status\": \"No mens rea: Genuine interpretation dispute; prosecution barred\"}\n        \n    threshold_25_lakh = 2500000.0  # Rs 25 Lakh\n    \n    if tax_evaded_inr > threshold_25_lakh:\n        charge = \"Section 276C(1)(i): Rigorous Imprisonment (Min 6 months, Max 7 years) + Fine\"\n        imprisonment_bracket = \"6 Months to 7 Years\"\n    else:\n        charge = \"Section 276C(1)(ii): Rigorous Imprisonment (Min 3 months, Max 2 years) + Fine\"\n        imprisonment_bracket = \"3 Months to 2 Years\"\n        \n    if can_compound:\n        # Standard CBDT Compounding Fee: ~50% of tax evaded\n        compounding_fee = tax_evaded_inr * 0.50\n        resolution = f\"Eligible for Compounding under Sec 279(2) upon payment of INR {compounding_fee:,.2f}\"\n    else:\n        compounding_fee = 0.0\n        resolution = \"Non-compoundable / Trial must proceed in Special Economic Offences Court\"\n        \n    return {\n        \"prosecution_initiated\": True,\n        \"tax_evaded_inr\": tax_evaded_inr,\n        \"statutory_charge\": charge,\n        \"imprisonment_exposure\": imprisonment_bracket,\n        \"compounding_resolution\": resolution,\n        \"compounding_fee_inr\": compounding_fee\n    }\n\npros_res = evaluate_criminal_prosecution(tax_evaded_inr=10000000.0, is_willful_attempt=True, can_compound=True)\nprint(f\"Prosecution Initiated: {pros_res['prosecution_initiated']}\")\nprint(f\"Statutory Charge: {pros_res['statutory_charge']}\")\nprint(f\"Imprisonment Exposure: {pros_res['imprisonment_exposure']}\")\nprint(f\"Compounding Option: {pros_res['compounding_resolution']}\")\n",
